### Get Events

GET {{rooturl}}/api/events/list

### Get Events Including Expired

GET {{rooturl}}/api/events/list?includeExpired=true

### Options Events

OPTIONS {{rooturl}}/api/events/list

### Get Tracks

@trackSearchTerm = david guetta

GET {{rooturl}}/api/tracks/search?query={{trackSearchTerm}}

### Options Tracks

OPTIONS {{rooturl}}/api/tracks/search?query={{trackSearchTerm}}

### Delete Cache
DELETE {{rooturl}}/api/events/deletecache
x-ms-client-principal: {{fakeprincipal}}

### Update Event Index (non-destructive - adds new fields to existing index)
POST {{rooturl}}/api/events/updateindex
x-ms-client-principal: {{fakeprincipal}}

### Make Requesst
POST {{rooturl}}/api/musicrequest/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "eventId":"459c5d02-2c58-41ff-856b-8f410317fee9",
    "musicRequest":"Test no bpm or time",
    "requestedBy":"From The Floor",
    "bpm": null,
    "time":""
}

### Make Request with string bpm
POST {{rooturl}}/api/musicrequest/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "eventId":"459c5d02-2c58-41ff-856b-8f410317fee9",
    "musicRequest":"Test string bpm",
    "requestedBy":"From The Floor",
    "bpm": "116.0",
    "time":""
}

### Submit Contact Form
POST {{rooturl}}/api/contact/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test Visitor",
    "email": "visitor@example.com",
    "subject": "DJ hire enquiry",
    "message": "Hi Mark, are you available for a birthday event?",
    "company": "",
    "elapsedMs": 8000
}

###
### AI Chat - DJ mode (authenticated, expects the DJ flavour: asks who the request is for)
POST {{rooturl}}/api/aichat/message
Content-Type: application/json
x-ms-client-principal: {{fakeprincipal}}

{
    "eventId":"459c5d02-2c58-41ff-856b-8f410317fee9",
    "mode":"dj",
    "messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Someone's just asked for Valerie by Mark Ronson"}]
}

### AI Chat - DJ mode claimed without authentication (must fall back to the dancer flavour)
POST {{rooturl}}/api/aichat/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "eventId":"459c5d02-2c58-41ff-856b-8f410317fee9",
    "mode":"dj",
    "messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Someone's just asked for Valerie by Mark Ronson"}]
}

###

### Import - list Ceroc Freestyle events (authenticated)
GET {{rooturl}}/api/import/ceroc/list
x-ms-client-principal: {{fakeprincipal}}

### Import - list without authentication (expects 401)
GET {{rooturl}}/api/import/ceroc/list

### Import - draft an event from a Ceroc page (authenticated, calls Azure OpenAI)
POST {{rooturl}}/api/import/ceroc/event
Content-Type: application/json
x-ms-client-principal: {{fakeprincipal}}

{
    "url":"https://www.ceroc.com/30/14294/energise-on-sunday"
}

### Import - non-Ceroc URL (expects 400)
POST {{rooturl}}/api/import/ceroc/event
Content-Type: application/json
x-ms-client-principal: {{fakeprincipal}}

{
    "url":"https://example.com/"
}

###

### Import - write a new description from the Create Event form (authenticated, calls Azure OpenAI)
POST {{rooturl}}/api/import/description
Content-Type: application/json
x-ms-client-principal: {{fakeprincipal}}

{
    "name":"Ceroc Tadcaster - 2 Room Freestyle",
    "description":"Two rooms of freestyle at Riley Smith Hall. Main room upbeat, second room blues and chill 9pm-11pm. £10 on the door.",
    "locationName":"Tadcaster Riley Smith Hall",
    "locationAddress":"Westgate, Tadcaster, LS24 9AB",
    "date":"2026-12-11",
    "times":"20:00 - 23:30",
    "tags":"DJ Mark, Christmas, 2 Room",
    "organizer":"Ceroc Yorkshire",
    "isRequestable":true
}

